          "snippet": {
            "text": "  have h1 := sum_odd_inv_sqrt_le (K / d)\n  have h2 : ((K / d : ℕ) : ℝ) ≤ y / d := by\n    refine (Nat.cast_div_le).trans ?_\n    gcongr; exact Nat.floor_le hy\n  calc 1 / (d : ℝ) * ∑ t ∈ (Icc 1 (K / d)).filter Odd, 1 / √(t : ℝ)\n      ≤ 1 / d * √(y / d) := by\n        gcongr; exact h1.trans (sqrt_le_sqrt h2)",
